{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-ctrl","type":"group","label":"🖥️ Control Plane & Local Config","x":-600,"y":-220,"width":450,"height":720,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ctrl-cli","type":"text","text":"### 🖥️ CLI Controller\n- `./cnsr.sh <command>`\n- Multi-language support (`zh` / `en`)\n- Interactive mode & `--detach` async execution","x":-560,"y":-160,"width":370,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ctrl-env","type":"text","text":"### 🔐 Environment Variables (.env)\n- **AWS**: Access Key & Secret\n- **Cloudflare**: API Token & Zone ID\n- **Telegram**: Bot Token & Chat ID\n- **Zero-Key Gateway**: Edge Auth","x":-560,"y":40,"width":370,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ctrl-ssh","type":"text","text":"### 📁 SSH Config Management\n- `~/.ssh/config` idempotent updates\n- Host alias to real IP/domain mapping\n- Dedicated Ed25519 keypair isolation","x":-560,"y":260,"width":370,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-aws","type":"group","label":"🚀 Core Workflow: AWS Batch Provisioning (init-aws)","x":0,"y":-640,"width":1000,"height":840,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Cloud API Batch Creation\n- Load `templates/*.conf` preset\n- Inject public key to Cloud-Init (`user_data`)\n- Concurrent AWS Lightsail instance creation","x":40,"y":-580,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step2","type":"text","text":"### 2. Staggered SSH Probing\n- Micro-staggering delay to smooth burst\n- Passwordless SSH handshake (`admin` / `root`)\n- Append initial host entry to `~/.ssh/config`","x":520,"y":-580,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Dual-Stack & Camouflage Domain\n- Probe public IPv4 & IPv6 (`ifconfig.me`)\n- Derive subnet CIDR range\n- Generate corporate subdomain (`edge-cache-v727`)\n- Retrieve Cloudflare zone root domain","x":40,"y":-340,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step4","type":"text","text":"### 4. Cloudflare DNS Sync with Retries\n- Clean up redundant A/AAAA records\n- **Backoff + Jitter** A record creation\n- **Backoff + Jitter** AAAA record creation\n- Update `~/.ssh/config` to target domain","x":520,"y":-340,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Zero-Key Gateway Cloud Scan\n- Package target IP and CIDR payload\n- Invoke Cloudflare Worker gateway endpoint\n- Trigger GitHub Actions security scanner\n- Zero token exposure on remote nodes","x":40,"y":-80,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aws-step6","type":"text","text":"### 6. Node Provisioning & Hardening\n- Sync sanitized env, runner shim, watchdog\n- Install Docker & start X-ray Reality\n- Configure UFW firewall (TCP 22/443, UDP 443)\n- Inject 15-minute Cron self-healing watchdog","x":520,"y":-80,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-rot","type":"group","label":"🔄 Core Workflow: Self-Healing & Rotation (rotate-*)","x":0,"y":280,"width":1000,"height":660,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rot-sni","type":"text","text":"### 🎭 rotate-sni (Fingerprint & SNI)\n- Reset UUID, ShortID, x25519 keypair\n- Score and select cleanest candidate SNI\n- Hot-reload Docker container & env\n- Neutralize active TLS probing","x":40,"y":340,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rot-dns","type":"text","text":"### 🌐 rotate-dns (Domain Migration)\n- Fetch current dual-stack node IPs\n- Generate fresh enterprise subdomain\n- Update Cloudflare A/AAAA records\n- Cascade update local `~/.ssh/config`","x":520,"y":340,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rot-ip","type":"text","text":"### ⚡ rotate-ip (IP Reallocation Healing)\n- Invoke AWS API to release blocked static IP\n- Allocate new AWS static IP and attach\n- Cascade update SSH config & Cloudflare DNS\n- Re-trigger GitHub Actions scanner","x":40,"y":620,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rot-cron","type":"text","text":"### ⏱️ Remote Watchdog Cron\n- Trigger `runner.sh` every 15 minutes\n- Check X-ray container health & auto-restart\n- Verify outbound reachability & alarm on fault","x":520,"y":620,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"group-chk","type":"group","label":"🩺 Core Workflow: Node Diagnostics (check & test)","x":0,"y":1020,"width":1000,"height":450,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"chk-diag","type":"text","text":"### 📊 Comprehensive Health Audit (check)\n- **Latency**: IPv4 / IPv6 TCP handshake latency\n- **TLS Quality**: SNI negotiation duration\n- **Kernel**: BBR congestion control verification\n- **Service**: Docker container uptime & restart count","x":40,"y":1080,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"chk-test","type":"text","text":"### 🧪 Simulation & Testing (test-*)\n- `test-sni`: Dry-run candidate SNI scoring without changes\n- `test-tg`: Push 5-alert sample pack to Telegram\n  (Node Ready, Rotated, Alarm, Health, Routine)","x":520,"y":1080,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"group-infra","type":"group","label":"🛡️ Remote Node Infrastructure (Target VPS)","x":1100,"y":-220,"width":450,"height":720,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"infra-ufw","type":"text","text":"### 🛡️ UFW Dual-Stack Firewall\n- Default deny all incoming traffic\n- Allow TCP 22 (SSH management)\n- Allow TCP 443 & UDP 443 (Reality service)","x":1140,"y":-160,"width":370,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"infra-xray","type":"text","text":"### 🐳 X-ray Reality Container\n- Docker Compose isolated execution\n- VLESS Reality anti-blocking protocol\n- Dynamic sanitized env & cert fingerprint","x":1140,"y":40,"width":370,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"infra-sec","type":"text","text":"### 🔒 Sanitized Credentials\n- Whitelist sync: ZERO AWS/CF/GH tokens\n- Minimal runtime privileges on node\n- Zero upstream credential leakage on compromise","x":1140,"y":260,"width":370,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-obs","type":"group","label":"📢 Notification & Edge Gateway","x":1650,"y":-220,"width":400,"height":720,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tg-alerts","type":"text","text":"### 🔔 Telegram Bot Notification Cards\n- 🚀 **Node Ready**: Tier, Dual-Stack IP, domain\n- ⚡ **IP Rotated**: Old IP released & new IP active\n- 🚨 **Self-Healing Alarm**: Connectivity or container fault\n- 📋 **Daily Audit**: Latency & multi-dimension health\n- 🌈 **Formatting**: Rainbow banners & MarkdownV2","x":1690,"y":-160,"width":320,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tg-gw","type":"text","text":"### 🌐 Zero-Key Cloud Scanner Gateway\n- Hosted on Cloudflare Workers\n- Isolates GitHub PAT & dispatch permissions\n- Shields local workstation and remote nodes","x":1690,"y":200,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"1"}
	],
